# Conformance probe pack naming an inner pack on another wire (spec 0.34,
# What an inner pack may be): conformance-absent-json is a json pack.
format     conformance-inner-badwire
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.n  8  uint
inner   conformance-absent-json
